{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/3ad0d4459ef8b35732e842906b410762.avif?t=1772744458\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE CHARACTER, TWO PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input offers a unique platforming experience where control is split between two players.<br>One player manages movement, the other handles actions. Perfect coordination is the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/e6370705c9d545ae26759e6f9b5ab48f.poster.avif?t=1772744458\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/e6370705c9d545ae26759e6f9b5ab48f.webm?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/e6370705c9d545ae26759e6f9b5ab48f.mp4?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIMING IS EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single mistimed input means failure. Levels are designed to push your reflexes and teamwork to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9ca693cae669c9534b377d2e55b92e37.poster.avif?t=1772744458\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9ca693cae669c9534b377d2e55b92e37.webm?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9ca693cae669c9534b377d2e55b92e37.mp4?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARKOUR AND PLATFORMING CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, cling to walls, and overcome obstacles. Parkour-inspired levels will test both your speed and your cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/870e81e1cb4acdc82308dfd6ecf77569.poster.avif?t=1772744458\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/870e81e1cb4acdc82308dfd6ecf77569.webm?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/870e81e1cb4acdc82308dfd6ecf77569.mp4?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE MOVES, THE OTHER ACTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input is built exclusively for two players. With one responsible for movement and the other for actions, every step requires flawless collaboration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINIMALIST DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean, stylized aesthetic keeps your focus on the gameplay itself. Each level is a clear but demanding challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One character controlled by two players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour-inspired, challenging platforming levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay based entirely on timing and coordination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist visuals with a focused design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Input</strong> looks simple but mastering it is anything but easy. Without true cooperation, no obstacle can be overcome.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016010?t=1772744458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/f265037247dae8ed2c2c8233477a40ec4c064c76/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772744458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/609aac6065bc2b1a39bfc186af1f5117cccd946b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772744458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/609aac6065bc2b1a39bfc186af1f5117cccd946b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772744458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4407380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/3ad0d4459ef8b35732e842906b410762.avif?t=1772744458\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE CHARACTER, TWO PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input offers a unique platforming experience where control is split between two players.<br>One player manages movement, the other handles actions. Perfect coordination is the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/e6370705c9d545ae26759e6f9b5ab48f.poster.avif?t=1772744458\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/e6370705c9d545ae26759e6f9b5ab48f.webm?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/e6370705c9d545ae26759e6f9b5ab48f.mp4?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIMING IS EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single mistimed input means failure. Levels are designed to push your reflexes and teamwork to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9ca693cae669c9534b377d2e55b92e37.poster.avif?t=1772744458\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9ca693cae669c9534b377d2e55b92e37.webm?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9ca693cae669c9534b377d2e55b92e37.mp4?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PARKOUR AND PLATFORMING CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, cling to walls, and overcome obstacles. Parkour-inspired levels will test both your speed and your cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/870e81e1cb4acdc82308dfd6ecf77569.poster.avif?t=1772744458\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/870e81e1cb4acdc82308dfd6ecf77569.webm?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/870e81e1cb4acdc82308dfd6ecf77569.mp4?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE MOVES, THE OTHER ACTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input is built exclusively for two players. With one responsible for movement and the other for actions, every step requires flawless collaboration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINIMALIST DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean, stylized aesthetic keeps your focus on the gameplay itself. Each level is a clear but demanding challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One character controlled by two players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour-inspired, challenging platforming levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay based entirely on timing and coordination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist visuals with a focused design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Input</strong> looks simple but mastering it is anything but easy. Without true cooperation, no obstacle can be overcome.</p>","developers":["F\u0131rat Zeren"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/755654ac8f69aba9519aa2bb087bfa255be7a8c6/header.jpg?t=1772744458","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4016010/1847167450/d0be208beb0a671252385b07823eda13c0f3148b/1771931571/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771932934","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4016010/1847167450/d0be208beb0a671252385b07823eda13c0f3148b/1771931571/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771932934","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4016010/1847167450/d0be208beb0a671252385b07823eda13c0f3148b/1771931571/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771932934","